  "version": 2,
  "versionNote": "One file for every version: a rule added later names its first version in a \"rules\" condition [from, to), so worlds made with older rules keep their ground (EarthParams.GroundColumns). 2 (EA-0062, decision 0076, 13 November 2026): karst-cool.",
