  "extent": [-180.0, -90.0, 180.0, 90.0],
  "extentNote": "west, south, east, north: where ground columns are on (the whole world, the author, 6 November). Soil and cover everywhere; bedrock only where a template applies, elsewhere the rock below the cover is Earth's regional geology.",

